Some features require extra packages:

    cryptsetup: `ugrd.crypto.cryptsetup' support
    btrfs-progs: `ugrd.fs.btrfs' support
    gnupg: `ugrd.crypto.gpg' support
    e2fsprogs: `ugrd.fs.ext4' support
    f2fs-tools: `ugrd.fs.f2s' support
    lvm2[lvm]: `ugrd.fs.lvm' support
    zfs: `ugrd.fs.zfs' support
    mdadm: `ugrd.fs.mdraid' support
    plymouth: `ugrd.base.plymouth' support
    python3-zstandard: Zstd compression support
